// DevPilot AI — Architecture globale  (paste into https://app.eraser.io  → Diagram as Code)
title DevPilot AI — Architecture globale

colorMode bold
styleMode shadow
typeface clean
direction down

User [icon: user, color: gray]

Client [icon: monitor, color: blue] {
  Frontend [icon: nextjs, label: "Next.js 15 · React 19"]
}

API Gateway [icon: server, color: blue] {
  FastAPI [icon: python, label: "FastAPI · REST + SSE"]
  Auth [icon: lock, label: "JWT · RBAC"]
}

Orchestration [icon: workflow, color: purple] {
  Workflow [icon: cpu, label: "Agentic RAG Workflow · 7 agents"]
}

Async Processing [icon: refresh-cw, color: orange] {
  Redis [icon: redis, label: "Redis · broker/cache"]
  Celery [icon: python, label: "Celery worker"]
}

Data Layer [icon: database, color: green] {
  Postgres [icon: postgresql, label: "PostgreSQL 16 · état + traces"]
  Qdrant [icon: database, label: "Qdrant · HNSW cosinus 768-d"]
}

AI Providers [icon: cpu, color: teal] {
  Ollama [icon: server, label: "Ollama · nomic-embed-text"]
  Gemini [icon: google, label: "Gemini 2.5 Flash"]
}

Observability [icon: activity, color: red] {
  Prometheus [icon: prometheus]
  Grafana [icon: grafana]
}

User > Frontend: question
Frontend > FastAPI: HTTPS / SSE
FastAPI > Auth
FastAPI > Workflow
FastAPI > Redis: enqueue
Redis > Celery
Workflow > Qdrant: recherche
Workflow > Ollama: embeddings
Workflow > Gemini: génération (stream)
Celery > Ollama: embeddings
Celery > Qdrant: upsert
FastAPI > Postgres
Celery > Postgres
FastAPI > Prometheus
Prometheus > Grafana
